[h2]Build 0.9.57[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The [b]"No storage connected"[/b] alert no longer shows for the pressurised hot water and exhaust networks. It's a Vanilla Expanded Framework alert that only counts its own storage buildings, so it fired even with an Overpressure Tank or exhaust expansion tank connected. Those tanks were working all along.
[/list]
